# PocketSmart AI — Project Demonstration Phase

 ## 1\. Demonstration Objective

 The **Project Demonstration Phase** should show that PocketSmart AI can take a user's financial information, analyze spending behavior, generate a budget, and provide understandable AI-powered recommendations.

 The demonstration should follow a realistic user journey rather than showing individual screens randomly.

 ### Demonstration flow

```
Login
  ↓
Dashboard
  ↓
Add Income & Expenses
  ↓
AI Categorization
  ↓
Budget Creation
  ↓
Spending Analysis
  ↓
AI Recommendation
  ↓
Savings Goal
  ↓
"What Can I Afford?" Simulation
  ↓
Final Financial Summary
```

---

