 # 5\. Screen 3 — Add Expense

 Demonstrate manual expense entry.

 ### Example

```
Amount:       ₹450
Description:  Dinner with friends
Category:     Food
Date:         Today

              [ Add Expense ]
```

 After clicking **Add Expense**, the dashboard updates.

 ### AI version

 You can demonstrate natural-language entry:

 > “I spent ₹450 on dinner yesterday.”

 PocketSmart extracts:

```
Amount     → ₹450
Category   → Food
Description → Dinner
Date       → Yesterday
```

 This is one of the best features to demonstrate because it shows the AI component directly.

